      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA ULTIMATE (1) was in the money last time out when second and beaten 1.75 lengths at Ballarat over 450m (25.60). Missed the frame only look here. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Good form should continue. GLISTENING (7) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Spanish Armada (25.88) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Expected to feature. CHEEKY MEEKI (2) is a handy type who notched her 7th career success when too good (22.08) from Box 2 at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from four starts. Leading chance again. CHIC IN PARIS (4) boasts a solid strike-rate over this track and distance.",
